    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A Superb Four Bedroom Country Home on Circa 1.3 Acres\n\n. \nGVM Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the market this truly superb dormer-style, six-bedroom detached residence, standing proudly on a beautifully appointed circa 1.3-acre site in a wonderfully private and tranquil setting, just minutes from the picturesque and hugely popular village of Pallaskenry.\n\nThis is a home that immediately impresses. Approached via wrought-iron entrance gates flanked by natural stone walls, a substantial sweeping driveway leads to generous setdown and parking areas, all surrounded by mature, beautifully landscaped gardens. The grounds are arranged over two tiers and feature established trees, colourful shrubbery and attractive flower beds, creating a wonderful sense of privacy and seclusion.\n\nCountry Living: \n\nOne of the great attractions of this property is its exceptional location. While enjoying all the peace, privacy and space of a countryside setting, this superb home is positioned just 20 minutes` drive from Limerick City, with convenient access to the nearby motor way network. University Hospital Limerick, Raheen Business Park and The Crescent Shopping Centre are all within easy reach.\n\n This magnificent property offers the perfect opportunity to embrace country living without compromising on accessibility.\n\n\nBright, Spacious and Exceptionally Versatile\n\n: Internally, the residence provides bright, generous and beautifully proportioned living and bedroom accommodation, ideally suited to modern family life.\nThe ground-floor accommodation includes an inviting entrance hall, comfortable lounge and an impressive open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, creating a wonderful central hub for everyday family living and entertaining.\n\n\nA particular highlight is the sun-drenched conservatory, which takes full advantage of the excellent orientation, with double doors opening onto the manicured rear gardens an idyllic setting for relaxing or entertaining while enjoying the evening sunshine.\n\n\nThere are four bedrooms at ground-floor level, including a spacious master bedroom with en-suite, together with the main family bathroom.\n\n\nUpstairs are two exceptionally large and versatile rooms, offering enormous potential. These spaces are ideally suited for use as additional bedrooms, home offices, workspaces, hobby rooms or further living accommodation, depending on the requirements of the new owners.\n\n\nThe Grounds\n\n: Outside, the property continues to impress. The circa 1.3 acre site has been thoughtfully developed and maintained, with extensive lawns, mature trees, established shrubbery and flower beds combining to create an attractive and peaceful setting.\n\nThe substantial driveway provides excellent parking and circulation space, while a detached garage offers valuable additional storage, workshop or hobby space.\n\n\nFor those seeking room to grow, space to work from home, beautiful outdoor surroundings and easy access to Limerick City and Pallaskenry & Kildimo Villages, this outstanding property ticks all the boxes. \n\nA truly special home in a wonderful setting. Inspection very highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hallway - 4.07m (13'4\") x 2.03m (6'8\")\nTiled flooring. Hotpress\n\nLounge - 4.08m (13'5\") x 4m (13'1\")\nFeature fireplace. Tiled flooring. Overlooking front garden.\n\nLiving / Dining room - 8.05m (26'5\") x 4.02m (13'2\")\nLaminated flooring, Feature stone fireplace. Solid fuel stove. Recessed lighting.\n\nKitchen - 3.04m (10'0\") x 3.06m (10'0\")\nTiled flooring. Generous floor and eye level presses. Tiling. Patio doors.\n\nUtility - 3.04m (10'0\") x 1.07m (3'6\")\nTiled flooring. Fully plumbed.\n\nWC and whb - 2.05m (6'9\") x 1.02m (3'4\")\n\nConservatory - 3.08m (10'1\") x 3.07m (10'1\")\nTiled flooring. Patio doors to rear and feature patio area.\n\nBathroom - 3.04m (10'0\") x 2.02m (6'8\")\nFully fitted. Fully tiled.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.01m (13'2\") x 3.06m (10'0\")\nDouble bedroom. Solid wood flooring.\n\nBedroom 2 - 5m (16'5\") x 3.04m (10'0\")\nMaster bedroom. Solid wood flooring. Built in wardrobes. \nEnsuite off :- Tiled flooring and electric shower.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.05m (10'0\") x 3.04m (10'0\")\nDouble bedroom. Solid wooden flooring.\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.05m (10'0\") x 3.04m (10'0\")\nDouble bedroom. Solid wooden flooring\n\nFirst floor\n\nOffice/Storage - 8.07m (26'6\") x 4.06m (13'4\")\nDouble bedroom. Laminated flooring.\n\nOffice/Storage - 8.03m (26'4\") x 4.06m (13'4\")\nDouble bedroom. Laminated flooring. Velux windows.\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
